  "name": "bedbug",
  "_about": "The bedbug (Cimex lectularius), 5 mm long: flat and oval, rusty brown; a broad round abdomen ringed with its segments, a pronotum wider than the head with a hollowed front edge, two tiny wing pads; a short broad head with bulging eyes, four-jointed antennae and a beak folded underneath; short legs; covered in fine hairs. Variant: fed (darker, plumper). Written whole by tools/creaturegen/rework/insects/bugs.py on insectlib.py (jointed legs on a walking gait, the antennae on bones of their own that wave).",
